# Trial log

When a command, parser, or approach fails and a later attempt works, or a sample file disagrees with the brief, append an entry to `docs/trial-log.md` before finishing.

Use the heading format already in that file: what was tried, why it failed, and what to do instead.

Skip typos and one-off sandbox noise that will not recur.
